**Vita**

Aya Ishihara was born in Fujinomiya-city, Shizuoka, Japan on September 12, 1974, the daughter of Keiko Ishihara and Takashi Ishihara. After completing her study at Jiyunomori High School, Hanno-city, Saitama, Japan in 1993 she entered Science University of Tokyo in 1994. She received the degree of Bachelor of Science in Physics from Science University of Tokyo in March, 1998. She started her continued study in physics enrolling in the program of the Graduate School of the University of Texas at Austin in August, 1998.

